WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.890
Lemon juice and soap. What do they have in common?

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:07.870
Both sit on the pH scale, from 0 to 14.

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:10.790
7 is neutral, like pure water.

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:14.510
Below 7 is acidic. Lemon juice is about 2.

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:18.160
Above 7 is alkaline. Soap is about 10.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:21.013
Opposite ends of the same scale.
